<https://hexplain.io/ns/fn#bytes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use to invoke a SPARQL extension function that reaches the bytes, parsed values, array cells or aspect coordinates of an asset described by a Hexplain profile. Pure functions also run as a SHACL-AF sh:SPARQLFunction body without the Hexplain engine; native functions require it. Use this IRI as a controlled value where the profile or a shape accepts its declared type."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/fn#bytes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/fn> .
